https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3987)-compliant URI string.\\n\\nFor example, `\\\"https://example.myshopify.com\\\"` is a valid URL. It includes a scheme (`https`) and a host\\n(`example.myshopify.com`).\\n\",\"fields\":{},\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"URL\"}},\"typesScope\":\"inputs\"}"
            source: "graphql"
